                            {
                                "target_word": "marketing",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ffb8197b-ad12-3e43-a463-21fd28bdc7ac",
                                        "entry_id": "5b490e79-6391-3c6c-886c-d1155ee611c6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Buying and/or selling in a market (street market or market fair)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3b7e8fae-e384-4a2c-8f9b-1d1074c2804c",
                                                "sense_id": "ffb8197b-ad12-3e43-a463-21fd28bdc7ac",
                                                "text": "The final result of the extreme seasonality of marketings of cattle and calves in Arkansas would have been an inshipment of either slaughter cattle or block beef and beef products during three quarters of the year."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "995778a8-9713-3146-a003-1f8ee721bcdb",
                                        "entry_id": "5b490e79-6391-3c6c-886c-d1155ee611c6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Buying and/or selling in a market (street market or market fair).",
                                            "Shopping, going to market as a buyer."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Philippines",
                                            "archaic",
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "edd4cc58-83a2-4137-8f07-0653a27a95a5",
                                                "sense_id": "995778a8-9713-3146-a003-1f8ee721bcdb",
                                                "text": "Although Miss Pross, through her long association with a French family, might have known as much of their language as of her own, if she had had a mind, she had no mind in that direction […] So her manner of marketing was to plump a noun-substantive at the head of a shopkeeper without any introduction in the nature of an article […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8430713e-126f-44b7-a22f-99c65ef507ef",
                                                "sense_id": "995778a8-9713-3146-a003-1f8ee721bcdb",
                                                "text": "[Wife to husband:] I'm going out to do my marketing – keep out of the kitchen, while I'm gone."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "09a19e68-f737-487d-8476-905310396a26",
                                                "sense_id": "995778a8-9713-3146-a003-1f8ee721bcdb",
                                                "text": "We did everything from laundry to house cleaning, washing dishes to cooking, and even marketing. Since I was gifted with the skills to cook, I volunteered to help out in the kitchen and do the marketing."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "52fb103b-a01b-3e18-947b-360b9b051009",
                                        "entry_id": "5b490e79-6391-3c6c-886c-d1155ee611c6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Buying and/or selling in a market (street market or market fair).",
                                            "Attending market as a seller."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "dated",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "40a07b63-3d54-4998-b4c9-0c2a499328ca",
                                                "sense_id": "52fb103b-a01b-3e18-947b-360b9b051009",
                                                "text": "Marketing was a time-consuming task for truck farming families, as the round trip could take most of the day."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "71ff8c50-0bed-36e7-9c5e-45ceaf55e01c",
                                        "entry_id": "5b490e79-6391-3c6c-886c-d1155ee611c6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The promotion, distribution and selling of a product or service; the work of a marketer; includes market research and advertising."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8b9bdb08-ed77-4184-a53e-84ed7313771b",
                                                "sense_id": "71ff8c50-0bed-36e7-9c5e-45ceaf55e01c",
                                                "text": "a bachelor's degree in marketing"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6fddabf5-6908-43e4-8b7e-c1b452de5156",
                                                "sense_id": "71ff8c50-0bed-36e7-9c5e-45ceaf55e01c",
                                                "text": "In America alone, people spent $170 billion on “direct marketing”—junk mail of both the physical and electronic varieties—last year. Yet of those who received unsolicited adverts through the post, only 3% bought anything as a result."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "61f5a0c8-3279-4ca5-8c1d-4e5f72cd8110",
                                                "sense_id": "71ff8c50-0bed-36e7-9c5e-45ceaf55e01c",
                                                "text": "Between 2000 and 2019, North Dakota and South Dakota both experienced a rapid increase in the Asian American population, said Minnesota State University Moorhead marketing professor Hyun Sang An."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4c5c42aa-6737-4469-adba-2283b44b2482",
                        "source_entry_id": "f4fbc607-7e3a-3ace-919d-785628bad73f",
                        "source_sense_id": "69293d09-d2ac-387d-82f7-b0311f344a7b",
                        "target_lang_word": "marketing",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "marketing",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "37520d31-4a41-3816-8adf-034f32626dcd",
                                        "entry_id": "9227291d-c66d-3d72-9fe9-2e5f81859b3d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "État d’esprit qui, dans une entreprise, accorde la primauté aux clients et à leurs attentes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Absolument"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cef9bdf8-cd42-4315-9fd0-afd631b87cd3",
                                                "sense_id": "37520d31-4a41-3816-8adf-034f32626dcd",
                                                "text": "Le marketing est une fonction de l’entreprise, mais c’est surtout une conception tout à fait particulière de l'activité commerciale, selon laquelle, les entreprises sont des institutions conçues pour attirer une clientèle et la conserver"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "47904785-9717-4614-ab89-dcf17d8c9d53",
                                                "sense_id": "37520d31-4a41-3816-8adf-034f32626dcd",
                                                "text": "Le marketing est la conquête méthodique et permanente d’un marché rentable, réalisée par un produit ou un service capable de satisfaire durablement les consommateurs visés."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7b3989e2-c3df-4eae-8167-ffaec3a81103",
                                                "sense_id": "37520d31-4a41-3816-8adf-034f32626dcd",
                                                "text": "Le marketing est un combat pour des parts de marché."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "487053a6-b024-35ff-ab39-72de867142ab",
                                        "entry_id": "9227291d-c66d-3d72-9fe9-2e5f81859b3d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "(Faire le marketing de quelque chose, d’un produit, la pratique du marketing) Méthodologie qui cherche à déterminer les offres de biens et services en fonction des attitudes des consommateurs et à favoriser leur commercialisation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2634eca8-99ab-415b-b949-9750ac57ded9",
                                                "sense_id": "487053a6-b024-35ff-ab39-72de867142ab",
                                                "text": "Dans la perspective d’optimiser le profit de l’entreprise, la pratique du marketing consiste à construire son offre compte tenu de la demande, du jeu des autres et des moyens dont on dispose dans un cadre politique choisi"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e32924f6-9cc1-4d97-8339-e3713b30c550",
                                                "sense_id": "487053a6-b024-35ff-ab39-72de867142ab",
                                                "text": "Le marketing est une méthodologie qui coordonne de façon logique des techniques, des outils et des méthodes à des fins stratégiques. Il concerne toutes les organisations dans leur processus d’échange sur les marché."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "baed4fa0-c3cb-4a33-9bc3-190c1d9df450",
                                                "sense_id": "487053a6-b024-35ff-ab39-72de867142ab",
                                                "text": "Lorsqu'une grande marque de produits agroalimentaires souhaite lancer un nouveau yahourt 0 % de matière grasse dédié à une clientèle féminine, elle recourt au marketing opérationnel."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6b27aec4-9e7b-427e-9d84-f5bc07a6e8d2",
                                                "sense_id": "487053a6-b024-35ff-ab39-72de867142ab",
                                                "text": "Pour faire une analogie, la carte de France est au pèlerinage de Compostelle ce qu'est une étude de marché à l’étude marketing exploratoire qu'on achèterait sur étagère à un cabinet réputé […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "93f1906c-9b56-4bcd-b032-92ad1a91c7a5",
                                                "sense_id": "487053a6-b024-35ff-ab39-72de867142ab",
                                                "text": "Le Marketing c’est l’ensemble des activités et des opérations qui interviennent depuis la création d'un produit jusqu'à sa destruction par le consommateur. Elle se divise en quatre séries : l'étude de marché, le produit, la distribution et la promotion."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
